OSTRICH is released under the Zero-Clause BSD license (0BSD): no attribution,
no notice preservation, no conditions.

That covers the code written for this project: everything under main/, host/,
tools/, components/audio_hal, components/display, components/emu,
components/imu, components/medal_input, components/medalboot, and the files
core/joust.c, core/joust.h, core/joust_internal.h, core/joust_sound.c,
core/joust_video.c and core/m6800.h. It does not cover core/e6809.c and
core/e6809.h, the MC6809 core from vecx, which are GPL-3.0: a build of this
project links that core in, so the combined firmware must be distributed under
the GPL-3.0 (the full text is in LICENSES/GPL-3.0.txt). Replace that one core
with a permissively licensed 6809 and the whole project is 0BSD.

It does not cover the game ROMs, which are not distributed here and never will
be. See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for the code this project is derived from.

